# AF-Cluster notebook

This folder contains the modified AF-Cluster notebook used for conformational-ensemble analysis.

## File

- `AFcluster.ipynb`  
  Modified Colab notebook used for DBSCAN-based MSA clustering and AlphaFold2 ensemble generation.

## Analysis settings

The AF-Cluster analysis used in the protocol applies:

- the internal >25% MSA gap filter implemented in the AF-Cluster workflow;
- AlphaFold2 `model_3_ptm`;
- three recycles;
- random seed 0.

## Usage

This notebook is intended to be run in Google Colab or a compatible Jupyter environment.

Users should provide the required MSA input files and retain the generated PDB files, cluster metadata, prediction scores and run logs for downstream post-processing.

## Related files

The downstream AF-Cluster post-processing script is located in:

```text
python/AFcluster_postprocess.py
